silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_07_backend_routing_observability_sections_02_profile_preservation_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 02_profile_preservation #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Profile Preservation Under Routing' the bare symbol TypeSeedLeg anchors to MittensVetRecordDependsOnCitationKey: The dependency arrow: the published claim depends on the citation key, which depends on the source-boundary declaration; reversing this would create a cycle and break acyclicity.." .
